    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>9级 游击</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 自然界 类人生物</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 95；''重伤'' 47</span><span>''先攻'' +8</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 23，''强韧'' 21，''反射'' 21，''意志'' 20</span><span>''侦查'' +5</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 7</span><span></span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">特性</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">恶犬夹击</div>\n<div class=description>人类海盗对被其夹击的敌人的攻击骰获得+1 加值，且其攻击对该生物造成 2d6 额外伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}海盗短弯刀（武器）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：+14 vs. AC<br>命中：2d6+5 伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">次要动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">绳上猴子✦遭遇</div>\n<div class=description>该人类海盗获得攀爬速度 7 直到其下回合结束。</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''技能'' 杂技+11，运动+11</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 14（+6）</span><span>''敏捷'' 15（+6）</span><span>''感知'' 12（+5）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 15（+6）</span><span>''智力'' 9（+3）</span><span>''魅力'' 11（+4）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 无</span><span style=flex-basis:auto>''语言'' 通用语</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''装备'' 海盗短弯刀（短剑）</span></div></div>\n</div>",
